      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 22,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "If a priest’s daughter is married to an outsider, she shall not eat of the heave offering of the holy things.",
      "ko": "제사장의 딸은 외국인에게 출가하였으면 거제의 성물을 먹지 못하되",
      "source_text_hash": "a60c92fd12e0291cd1b8e1499cadc622b06bbc6ce2dddaacb06d2876862be890",
      "translation_text_hash": "e617b7b421eb8f091abd68c14733329909800f3d1dff3fd76fa3aab8e02a7e5f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "제사장의 딸은 외국인에게 출가하였으면 거제의 성물을 먹지 못하되"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "e617b7b421eb8f091abd68c14733329909800f3d1dff3fd76fa3aab8e02a7e5f"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:22:13",
      "sequence": 3383,
      "chapter_label": "LEV 22",
      "verse_label": "13",
      "locator": {
