      "en": "The priests shall not profane the holy things of the children of Israel, which they offer to the LORD,",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손이 여호와께 드리는 성물을 그들은 더럽히지 말찌니",
      "source_text_hash": "1e2407da1da3162140ae027456cdc3370998c5044978875cd336d8ec2e95aa72",
      "translation_text_hash": "a2e913f6d27a9e63af21a4851aafd252775c8a3cbd07c45b87b3a4704053b0ee",
