      "en": "that you may be accepted, you shall offer a male without defect, of the bulls, of the sheep, or of the goats.",
      "ko": "열납되도록 소나 양이나 염소의 흠 없는 수컷으로 드릴찌니",
      "source_text_hash": "ad52144c5713277eedf9bfe2010da87b7a11bd28786085388bab41421628b7b5",
      "translation_text_hash": "e8ae5582a85806416a3dd6e5f409682ddeb0c4c9a13cb7c5820e2b5b775e30c4",
