      "en": "But you shall not offer whatever has a defect, for it shall not be acceptable for you.",
      "ko": "무릇 흠 있는 것을 너희는 드리지 말것은 그것이 열납되지 못할 것임이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0535a3f277739dfcc827cb4dce9fbac34df431b3cfc7d26a8e0084676cca8f27",
      "translation_text_hash": "c63398bcf057f5e334430befcc3dc8638f3c5485671703c0506478dc94597b71",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "무릇 흠 있는 것을 너희는 드리지 말것은 그것이 열납되지 못할 것임이니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "c63398bcf057f5e334430befcc3dc8638f3c5485671703c0506478dc94597b71"
