      "en": "You must not offer any of these as the bread of your God from the hand of a foreigner, because their corruption is in them. There is a defect in them. They shall not be accepted for you.’”",
      "ko": "너희는 외방인에게서도 이런 것을 받아 너희의 하나님의 식물로 드리지 말라 이는 결점이 있고 흠이 있는 것인즉 너희를 위하여 열납되지 못할 것임이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "61fc3fbcea579bb83dc7b753510b342b505b2b563ba7b6f06cc81b218fcbd337",
      "translation_text_hash": "1802af5b8ef2abe7f6e964ed313752076f2aaf1c745b055df34f6ec6385e2ce7",
