      "en": "“When a bull, a sheep, or a goat is born, it shall remain seven days with its mother. From the eighth day on it shall be accepted for the offering of an offering made by fire to the LORD.",
      "ko": "수소나 양이나 염소가 나거든 칠일 동안 그 어미와 같이 있게 하라 제 팔일 이후로는 여호와께 화제로 예물을 드리면 열납되리라",
      "source_text_hash": "921e01bd3f27ce19a72eede03634ac5057d244b42ffebaafb3d0ff138fd7781d",
      "translation_text_hash": "48146a36960eb264364fb26082a66067bd7b28756c2d15fd15beba5e92f9e2b0",
